{"id":"nedorazumenie","lemma":"недоразумение","pos":"noun","rank":2336,"glosses":["misunderstanding, misapprehension, misconception"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B7%D1%83%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"недоразумения","plural":"недоразумения"},"examples":[{"text":"Это всё недоразумение.","en":"It's all a misunderstanding.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Думаю, это было недоразумение.","en":"I think it was a misunderstanding.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Всё это было всего лишь недоразумение.","en":"It was all just a misunderstanding.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"only, no more than"]]},{"text":"Я уверен, что это просто недоразумение.","en":"I'm sure it's just a misunderstanding.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"why"]]},{"text":"Это, похоже, какое-то недоразумение.","en":"It seems to be a misunderstanding.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"it seems"},null,{"g":"that"},null]}]}